WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Next, we're going to go through different types of emergencies one at a time.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
First, we're going to focus on medical emergencies.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.000
We will explore exactly what these emergencies are,

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
the different things that can cause them,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
and the specific steps you can take to provide care before professional help arrives.

